# AI-Rulez Quick Start Demo
Output docs/assets/ai-rulez-demo.gif

# Terminal setup
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 30
Set BorderRadius 10
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

# Start demo
Type "# AI-Rulez: Lightning-fast AI assistant configuration"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# Initialize a new project with popular AI presets"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "npx ai-rulez init 'My Awesome Project' --preset popular --yes"
Enter

# Wait for the command to complete and show output
Sleep 30s